# AGENTS.md - Hybrid Workspace

Universal guidance for AI agents in hybrid workspaces — production agent quality without worktrees or CONTEXT.md files.

**Hybrid = full agent delegation chain + no worktrees + Opus planner as Phase 0 + no CONTEXT.md**

## ORCHESTRATOR: NEVER IMPLEMENT CODE DIRECTLY

Orchestrator NEVER writes code, tests, edits — not even "small" ones.

- **FORBIDDEN**: writing tests, editing source, fixing bugs inline, "just quickly" adding anything
- **ONLY allowed**: loading rules, reading context, creating session log, delegating to subagents (incl. committer)

Any code/tests → slice-specific dev (`developer-phoenix-backend`/`developer-phoenix-frontend`). No exceptions.

