## NEVER Commit Directly — Always Use Committer

Orchestrator + all subagents **must never run `git commit` directly**. All commits via committer subagent.

- ❌ `git commit -m "..."` from orchestrator or any other agent
- ✅ Delegate to committer with task summary; reads diff, crafts message
